WEBVTT

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:07.250
Come over here!

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:09.250
Here... Over here...

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.380
Right here...

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.670
I see that you can hear my voice.

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:17.960
Of course.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:18.790
What?

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:22.170
Al-kun, what's going on?
What do you mean, "of course"?

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:23.290
Al-kun?

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.330
You can't... See him?

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:26.670
Not at all...

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.290
Are you by chance...

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:31.040
what's called a ghost?

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:34.540
Yeah. My name is Rai.

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:39.420
I've been waiting here for a long time
for a person who could hear my voice.

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:42.750
By the way, Bro, that robe...

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:43.420
Huh?

00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:45.750
It looks like we match.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:50.170
I received this from a person called Helen-san,
who's the receptionist of the adventurer's guild.

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:51.830
I see... No wonder.

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:54.170
I was wearing that thing when I was alive.

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:58.330
It's a special item imbued with defensive magic
that I got from my old man.

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:00.830
Magic... Then that means...

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:06.460
Huh?! Wh-what are you doing all of a sudden?!

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:10.920
L-like something couples do together?

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:17.290
S-something's appeared!

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:19.880
I mean, his legs, they're transparent!
He's floating!

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:23.000
Sorry. Please continue with your story.

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:24.830
Thank goodness...

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:28.080
I take it Big Sis is still safe...

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:30.080
So, that means you're...

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:36.670
Yeah. Helen is my big sister.

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:38.080
And...

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:40.080
She's also this village's...

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:45.960
sole survivor.

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:51.880
But if I'm not mistaken,
Helen-san doesn't have memories of her past...

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:53.540
I see...

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:56.880
That was far too painful of an event, you see.

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:01.880
In order to protect her own mind,
it's understandable that she sealed that away.

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:04.710
But, if that's the case...

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:07.380
For that reason, Big Sis is in danger!

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:09.880
I'm begging you! Please save Big Sis!

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:48.040
<b>The Farmer and the Malevolent Dragon Ouroboros</b>

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:52.790
Rai-kun! Lunch is ready!

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:58.170
Take that! And that! And that!

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:05.460
Rai-kun?!

00:04:08.130 --> 00:04:09.080
Jeez...

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.790
this is why you should listen to me.

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:13.540
I told you to stop playing hero
because it's dangerous.

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:15.210
It's not playing!

00:04:15.210 --> 00:04:17.540
I'm gonna become a brave warrior!

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:18.540
You can't.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:20.330
What are you going to do
if you get hurt again?

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:23.210
Something like getting hurt
is a warrior's badge of honor.

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:25.420
You're such a worrywart, Big Sis.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:29.380
You are my one and only younger brother.

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:31.960
I can't help but worry, you know?

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:35.580
Stop it, Big Sis!

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:38.880
I'm not a kid who needs to
be protected all the time anymore!

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:39.710
Yes, yes.

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:41.960
Okay, stop it!

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:58.460
What the hell is this?!

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:00.380
The house...

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:04.170
Mom... Dad!

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:25.630
Go away!

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:27.830
No, don't!

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:34.330
I hate it when you humans show no fear like that!

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:37.380
Hope is like a poison to me.

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:40.000
I will strip it away and eradicate you!

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:44.080
Run-

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.170
Wh-what is that?!

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:02.710
I don't know, but this is too dangerous!

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:04.130
Anyway, we gotta run!

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:05.630
But everyone...

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:09.380
It's frustrating, but there's nothing
that just the two of us can do!

00:06:09.960 --> 00:06:11.540
Right now, we gotta run!

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:17.130
All right...

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:23.500
Dammit! But where can we go?!

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:29.210
Big Sis, what's wrong?!

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:31.670
We gotta run!

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:40.750
Do not think that you can
get away from me, damn kids!

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:49.380
Big Sis, this way!

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:54.250
That's right. Run, run!

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:59.540
I enjoy nothing more than seeing
your faces full of despair!

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:05.670
Big Sis!

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:08.670
Don't worry about me! Run, Rai-kun!

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:14.580
It appears this is it, little girl.

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:20.960
Well then, it's time for me to feast
while your body and soul are steeped in despair.

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:25.460
I... I did it...

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:29.460
Big Sis, now's your chance!

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:37.130
What?! It didn't work!

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:42.830
Did you think you could wound me
with something like that?!

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:43.880
Very well.

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:47.080
I shall begin by eating you first then!

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:49.330
Rai-kun!

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:50.960
Run, Big Sis!

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:04.790
Rai-kun!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.880
Big Sis... Run...

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.880
No! Rai-kun!

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:12.290
What a great expression.

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:16.790
Human despair fills me
with such a satisfying power!

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:22.880
However, I came too close
to annhilating all of you.

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:25.790
Humans are annoyingly fragile.

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:28.880
This isn't... It can't be like this...

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:31.960
You there, little girl, rest assured.

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:34.460
I will not kill you right away.

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:43.250
Fifteen years from now, I will appear once again
to kill you and eradicate the rest of the town.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:50.210
When that time comes, I'll enjoy dining
on your soul that's saturated in utter despair.

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:54.420
I won't let you...

00:08:54.830 --> 00:08:55.880
Huh?

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:59.670
Even if I die, I won't give up.

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:03.420
I will protect Big Sis from you for sure!

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:06.460
How impertinent... Very well.

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:10.880
Then I shall allow your soul to remain in this land.

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:16.580
You shall see with your own eyes
the dire fate that awaits your older sister.

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:22.420
Say what you want...

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:26.630
No matter what... I will...

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.380
Rai-kun?

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:32.460
No way...

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:34.460
This can't be!

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:37.210
No! Rai-kun!

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:41.000
Rai-kun!

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:49.960
And that's what happened
to this village 15 years ago.

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:52.710
That's terrible...

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:56.210
Whenever that bastard annhilates
a village or city,

00:09:56.210 --> 00:09:58.170
it always leaves one survivor.

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:03.210
Then after it sleeps for a time,
it awakens to find them and finish the job.

00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:04.290
What?

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:08.250
The person who survives tells someone about it.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:12.380
Having done that, the terrifying experience
becomes a rumor among the people.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:16.750
That starts a chain reaction,
and a renewed terror and legend is born.

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:22.540
When I was eaten, Ouroboros' consciousness
flowed into me and that's how I found out...

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:26.500
He was feasting upon
my fear of being chomped to bits!

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:31.750
By doing so, it eats the negative energy
of its prey and increases its power.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:37.710
The bastard is aiming for Big Sis
and the people who are near her now.

00:10:37.710 --> 00:10:39.750
That's why I want you to stop it somehow.

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:41.290
But...

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:44.380
If it's my powers, then I don't
stand a chance against that monster.

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:47.290
In that case, you shouldn't give it power.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.250
I told you.

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:53.790
The bastard uses the soul's negative energy
as nourishment to live.

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:59.420
At that time, it said eating
me would make my soul despair.

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:01.920
It's not about just killing.

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:05.250
Although it makes it look like
that is its number one objective.

00:11:07.420 --> 00:11:09.920
I see, so that means...

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:14.710
If you hit it with the opposite power of despair,
then the bastard's power should weaken!

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:16.250
That's why...

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:20.420
Please pass on to Big Sis what I'm about to say!

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:25.040
H-hang on! Stop!

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:26.460
Rai said it himself, you know?

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:30.380
Today marks the 15th year
that Ouroboros was talking about!

00:11:30.630 --> 00:11:31.880
We gotta hurry!

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:36.080
B-but if I'm seen in this position by people, then...

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:38.290
At least carry me like a princess!

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:43.080
Sorry, but this is the fastest way to harvest...
I mean, the way to run.

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:46.040
That may be true, but...!

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:52.130
Thank goodness.

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:54.500
It doesn't seem like Ouroboros has appeared yet.

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:56.040
Th-that's true...

00:11:56.040 --> 00:12:00.540
Anyway, Al-kun, you really are
monstorously strong, you know that?

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:05.000
But I think you need to study up
on how to treat a girl.

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:06.000
Huh?

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:12.540
Well, I'll supervise the soldiers and start
the evacuation of the people within the castle

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:14.580
in order to prepare for Ouroboros' attack.

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:16.290
Al-kun, please take care of Helen-san.

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:18.290
Understood. Let's hurry.

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:22.790
Helen.

00:12:23.830 --> 00:12:25.790
I peeled some rukabosu fruit.

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:28.790
You think you can eat?

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:33.080
Helen?

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:06.080
It's been a long time, little girl.

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:08.210
First time in 15 years, huh?

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:09.880
15 years...

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:12.000
That's right...

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:19.710
As promised, I've returned to dine upon
the frightened souls of you and your friends.

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:25.130
That's right... It was my fault...

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:27.580
Rai-kun... He died because...

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:33.130
Why had I forgotten such an important thing?

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:34.750
Rai-kun...

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:37.920
Sorry... I'm sorry...

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:46.380
What, you're saying that now?
Your younger brother died because of you.

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:51.130
He was pierced by my fangs.
How much pain he must have been in.

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:58.250
Your younger brother
could have run away as it was.

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:02.000
That is, if you had not been a hindrance.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:06.170
And yet again, a great number of humans
are going to die now.

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:08.790
Because you came to this country!

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:10.000
Do you feel it?

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:16.040
The despair of knowing that your foolishness
led to the death of all your friends!

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:20.170
It's my fault... I got everyone involved...

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:23.290
Everyone is going to die again.

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:25.290
No... That's...

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:28.040
Uh-huh... Well, what will you do?

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:30.830
Please...

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:34.790
I'm begging you, please be merciful
and just take my life...

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:41.290
That's right. That will do.

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:45.790
A robust scent of despair is welling up.

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:47.790
However...

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:53.170
Whether you live or die, those bastards
in that castle will be massacred!

00:14:53.170 --> 00:14:59.830
I will burn them, pulverize them,
and their pleasant screams will seethe within me!

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.080
No, that's...

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:04.080
This way! Hurry! Are you okay?

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:06.790
Hurry and give top priority
to the evacuation of the residents!

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:09.580
The knighthood will guard the castle gates!

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:16.540
Al-kun, please don't push yourself too hard...

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:20.960
What's the matter?

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:23.500
Are you not going to take your own life?

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:29.330
Or will you die after you burn into your memory
the hell that is about to arrive?

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:31.080
I'm sorry, Rai-kun...

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:33.210
After you went through so much to save me...

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.880
I'm also going to where you are now...

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:49.330
Looks like I somehow made it in time.

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:53.630
Al-kun...

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:55.500
Who the hell are you?!

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:57.420
Don't get in my way!

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:06.170
Al-kun!

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:08.000
Ouch...

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:12.250
If I hadn't been wearing this robe,
I would've been in trouble.

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:17.000
You're still alive after that hit just now...
Are you even human?

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:18.960
Al-kun! Run!

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:26.040
A human is a human, and....

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:32.960
I...

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:35.880
am a farmer!

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:53.040
Close call! I'm here to save you!

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:55.790
You're okay now.
You don't have to worry anymore.

00:16:58.380 --> 00:16:59.540
Huh...

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:04.330
You must be pretty good
to have gotten an attack through to me.

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:12.000
I guess you can't be defeated with just that after all.

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:15.710
Well, that's something I knew
from seeing your stats anyway.

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:18.130
If that's the case, let us continue.

00:17:18.130 --> 00:17:22.710
I look forward to seeing that face of yours
distort with despair and fear.

00:17:22.710 --> 00:17:25.380
Jeez, you really are one sick
and twisted dragon!

00:17:25.380 --> 00:17:27.830
Helen-san, get back for now.

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:28.710
B-but!

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:32.380
It's okay. I'll protect you, Helen-san.

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:35.460
I'll protect you, Big Sis.

00:17:38.460 --> 00:17:40.210
Now then, let's start!

00:17:40.210 --> 00:17:41.420
Interesting.

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:44.500
I wonder how far that composure will last!

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:27.920
Al-kun?!

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:33.130
I'm okay.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:36.920
A farmer isn't going to get wiped out from just that.

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:41.920
We do work out, so...

00:18:46.670 --> 00:18:48.380
Al-kun, please stop!

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:51.920
I don't want anyone
else to die because of me!

00:18:51.920 --> 00:18:52.880
You're wrong!

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:57.790
It's not your fault that anyone gets hurts.

00:18:57.960 --> 00:18:59.330
But it is!

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:03.080
What happened 15 years ago is my fault!
Even my brother's death!

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:05.040
All of it, it's all my fault!

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:08.580
Also, the fact that you're hurt
like this right now too!

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:11.170
Helen-san.

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:14.460
I met your younger brother, Rai-kun, today.

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:16.330
What?

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:21.170
He said that if you got your memories back,
then you'd definitely blame yourself.

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:22.830
So, he asked that I pass on at least this much...

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:24.290
He did?

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:28.080
"I don't regret that I was able to save Big Sis' life."

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:30.500
"Besides, if she was able to survive,

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:33.830
then it's her duty to become happy
on everyone's behalf."

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:38.330
"Make sure you live happily and let me be proud..."

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:44.000
...that I was able to save you, Big Sis!

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:52.460
Rai-kun...

00:19:52.880 --> 00:19:56.420
I've come to deliver hope to you, Helen-san.

00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:00.330
We can turn the tables on any bad situation,
as long as we never give up!

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:04.040
I wanted to tell you that there's no need to give up.

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:07.920
And... that is precisely...

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:11.380
Ouroboros' weak spot.

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:13.080
What...?

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:16.960
Wh-what are you doing?!

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:21.250
You know, there's no change
to this hopeless situation, little girl!

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:26.290
Grieve and ache with yearning! Then despair!

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:30.670
What are you in a hurry for?

00:20:30.670 --> 00:20:34.330
You know, your stats are rapidly going down.

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:35.960
Is that why?

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:45.130
It's just as Rai expected.

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:49.170
You eat people's despair
and change that into power.

00:20:49.420 --> 00:20:53.170
That's why, conversely,
hope can take away your power!

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:56.210
I'm no longer afraid of you!

00:20:57.960 --> 00:20:59.790
You're in my way, whelp!

00:20:59.790 --> 00:21:01.420
Die!

00:21:25.710 --> 00:21:29.290
His stats have gone down so far now
that I'm the one who's stronger.

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:32.460
Al-kun, you okay?!

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:34.290
Of course.

00:21:34.630 --> 00:21:36.460
More importantly, what about you?

00:21:46.880 --> 00:21:48.960
Helen-san?

